# The least share of lines and of branches (percent) the standard library's
# own tests must run in each file of lib/, checked by tools/stdlib-coverage.sh.
#
#   <file or glob>  <lines>  <branches>   # why
#
# The last line that names a file wins. '*' is the default every new file
# must meet; an override below it needs a reason, and one marked "raise me"
# is a file that was under the default when the check began: raise it (or
# drop the line) as its tests grow, never lower it.

*  85 70

# Under the default when the check began (raise me): the share each had then.
